    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="Example_40">
      <bpmn:text>Worked example
Ingredients ₱42.00 + packaging ₱3.00 + utilities ₱10.00 = ₱55.00
16% markup: ₱55.00 × 1.16 = ₱63.80
Round up to ₱65.00
Estimated margin: 15.38%</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
